      "text": "[8:37PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement from UBA Roundabout to Apongbon underneath bridge is good, Apongbon underneath bridge from Broad street is in order to Offin Canal. Inward Offin Canal to CMS is moving as expected, Offin Canal ascending Eko bridge via NEPA is moving at a faster rate. Leventis Elegbata Ebute Ero to Eko bridge is good. Outward journey is smooth, no impediments reported.\n\n#FollowLASTMA \n\n@followlasg \n@lagosMOT1 \n@seunosiyemi_ \n@TrafficChiefNG \n@Sola_Giwa \n@OlalekanOki \n@HeroPrince_21 \n@Mr_JAGs \n@lagostraffic961",
